## Third-party components

This project depends on packages that are distributed under their own licences,
all of them permissive and compatible with the MIT licence above:

| Package | Licence |
| --- | --- |
| `@noble/curves`, `@noble/hashes` | MIT |
| `@scure/base`, `@scure/btc-signer` | MIT |
| `sats-connect` | MIT |
| `next`, `react`, `react-dom` | MIT |
| `eslint`, `eslint-config-next`, `vitest` | MIT |
| `typescript` | Apache-2.0 |
| `playwright`, `playwright-core` (development browser QA only) | Apache-2.0 |

Fonts are served by `next/font/google` (Inter, Space Grotesk, JetBrains Mono)
and are self-hosted at build time under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, which
permits redistribution. The favicon (`app/icon.svg`), the social preview card
(`public/og.png`, generated from `scripts/social-preview.html`) and every
screenshot in this repository are original to this project.

There is no vendored code and no bundled binary asset of unknown provenance.
